Description:It is your second main phase. You control Drudge Skeletons, a Swamp and two Mountains, and have Pyroclasm in hand. The opponent controls Grizzly Bears. End the turn with Grizzly Bears in the opponent's graveyard and Drudge Skeletons on your battlefield.
Rule:authored-regenerate-shield | Regeneration is a replacement shield that must exist before the creature would be destroyed (CR 701.19a, 614.8): activate Drudge Skeletons' regeneration before Pyroclasm resolves; once lethal damage is marked, state-based actions destroy it before you get priority
